WEBVTT

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:15.100
Kada, you've got guts, coming
here to offer up your neck.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.280
You haven't forgotten the humiliating
words you said to me, have you?

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.580
That was a misunderstanding!

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.400
I just wanted to take care of your...

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.050
Impudence!

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.000
You will address her as Sousou-sama!

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.590
Sousou-sama's consti-

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:29.960
One more word, and I really
will cut off your head.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.280
I get it!

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.760
Just listen to me!

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:36.520
Don't you think it's worth listening
to what he has to say?

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:38.180
Old man Kada is a good guy!

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:39.130
Old man...

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:40.040
All right.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.830
We'll listen.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:45.730
But if it isn't worth our time...

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:47.860
You know what will happen.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.370
Shin

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:53.110
The Yellow Turban Rebellion is due
to the <i>Three Crucial Keys</i>?

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:54.410
Yes.

00:00:54.410 --> 00:01:02.440
From the intelligence I've gathered, the Three Chou Sisters are
using the <i>Crucial Keys</i> to control the Yellow Turbans.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:04.870
Why would the Three Chou Sisters do that?

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.170
I believe I mentioned this,

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:12.610
but the <i>Crucial Keys</i> has the power
to bring out a person's dark desires,

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:16.490
making them use magic to try to
plunge the world into chaos.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.550
I believe that to be what
has happened now.

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:23.080
They believed they were using the <i>Crucial
Keys</i> to liven up their act,

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:27.560
but they, themselves, were
being used, correct?

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.030
Koi

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:34.990
I've underestimated it, thinking it's a
simple book. I'd no idea of its power.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:36.280
Yes.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:41.450
We must seal it away before the
damage spreads any further.

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:42.510
That's true.

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:43.700
You're right.

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:47.960
Then first, we must eliminate the Yellow Turbans,
and the Three Chou Sisters must be...

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:49.120
Wait a moment.

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:50.590
Hime

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:54.430
The Three Chou Sisters are controlling
the Yellow Turbans.

00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:59.080
And it's the <i>Crucial Keys'</i>
fault that they're doing it!

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:05.070
So we only need seal it away.
We need not eliminate them...

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:09.700
You don't seem to understand the
situation, so I'll repeat it.

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:13.750
Tens of thousands of Yellow Turbans
surround the Three Chou Sisters.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:14.990
I know that!

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:20.460
Then you must realize we cannot get to the
book without dealing with them first, right?

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:29.080
You don't plan to tell me that you expect to say, "Let
us seal the book," assuming they'll say yes, do you?

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:30.470
Mu

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:35.130
B-But the Yellow Turbans
are just being controlled!

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.440
There must be a way without hurting them!

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:37.710
Don't be stupid!

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:41.890
There isn't an easy way to do this,
with no one getting hurt!

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:43.850
But...

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.310
Sou

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:53.140
I know!

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:55.610
Just maybe...

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:58.440
Do you have a plan?

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:03.480
Shin Koihime Musou

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:06.620
I fall to my knees in sadness

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.970
and hide my eyes,

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:16.460
but I don't regret these tears I've shed.

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:19.980
When people are happy,

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:23.220
they smile naturally.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:29.680
But you were always smiling, weren't you,

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:44.070
believing in the emotions behind
each of our ideals?

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:51.160
You know those words you
gave me, which I treasure,

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:57.750
of finding a place where we
could smile at one another.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:04.650
I want to be held with the
hand you offered me.

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:11.000
Holding that desire deep in my heart,
I now believe even more.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:17.990
You know those words you
gave me, which I treasure,

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:24.360
of finding a place where we
could smile at one another.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:31.480
I want to be held with the
hand you offered me.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:29.950
I like this song.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:34.410
Yeah. I heard it was an
old song from Nanyou.

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:38.410
Holding that desire deep in my heart,
I now believe even more.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:43.670
Come to think of it, Karin-sama said she'd make
a song too, now what became of that?

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:57.050
<b>Episode 12
The General's
Attempt to Suppress
the Yellow Turban
Rebellion</b>

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:04.700
That's the Three Chou Sisters' stage?

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:09.580
The Yellow Turbans don't seem
to be particularly on guard.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:12.430
I hope we can sneak in.

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:13.550
I know!

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:14.780
Just maybe...

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:16.040
Do you have a plan?

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:19.650
When I was looking around the outskirts
of the Yellow Turbans' camp,

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:22.750
I noticed their control spell seems to work

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:26.710
only on those whose hearts have
been stolen by their songs.

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:30.990
So if you regained them, using
the songs of another singer...

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:37.610
I see... Then they wouldn't be the
Chou Sisters' slaves anymore!

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:41.520
If we're only up against the sisters themselves,
it should be easy to catch them!

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:48.010
But that plan relies on having a singer
to match the Chou Sisters.

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.180
Where will you find-

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:52.540
You can leave the singing to me!

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:53.440
OK!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:06:02.920
Holding that desire deep in my heart,
I now believe even more.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:05.700
Wow!

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:08.300
You two really are good at singing!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:13.280
I'm surprised. I thought your only
talent in life was eating honey.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:15.180
I didn't know you could sing.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:19.690
Eats honey and sings... She's like a cricket.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.070
It's so true!

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:24.410
Come on. Let's talk more
about how great I am.

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:25.820
Way to go, Miu-sama!

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:29.660
A true lady is impervious to any
and every sort of sarcasm!

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:31.370
Amazing!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:34.700
Sousou-san, don't you think it has a chance?

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:37.370
Yeah. It's worth trying.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:43.840
But there are three of them... Ideally,
I'd like to have one more singer.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:47.070
What's wrong, Sister?

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:47.800
Are you ill?

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:51.120
Let me think... Who among
my army can sing?

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:54.260
Anyone?

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.480
Sister, be quiet.

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.860
If you're loud, you'll interrupt Karin-san.

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:05.170
Sousou-sama, if you have no other
options, I suggest Rin-chan.

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:07.190
Hey, Fuu, what are you talking about?

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:12.910
In her home village, she was called
the Songstress of the Yellow River.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:18.870
After a bath, she often sang and danced before
the mirror, lost in her own world.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:20.930
That's surprising.

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:22.530
Well, um...

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:24.840
Kakuka, I'm counting on you.

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:28.760
All right. Then let's start rehearsing!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.900
Choukun, you with the glasses, follow me.

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:33.720
A Songstress plan...

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.680
We can't bring any troops, or
else we'll alert the enemy.

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:40.640
If the plan fails, my Black Cavalry
will come rescue us,

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.800
but they'll likely be too late.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:45.110
Not that Enjutsu-dono has noticed...

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:53.490
Lately, Kakouton seems
unhappy. What's wrong?

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:57.300
Just leave her alone. It would be
bothersome to try and help.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:03.920
I am a bird... A bird that can't sing...

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.880
Everyone, here you are.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.670
What are those?

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:13.540
I had the Way of the Five Grains'
head prepare these for me.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:16.870
These jewels are enchanted
to amplify your voice.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:20.810
These are spells that play
music and control light.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:25.270
With those, we'll be able to
stand against the Chou Sisters!

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:29.230
But both have limits to their magic.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:35.440
In other words, if we don't end this before
they run out of magic, we lose.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:36.350
Yeah.

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:54.780
It's almost time.

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:59.470
But shouldn't you have waited at
the main camp, Ryuubi-dono?

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:03.530
My two sisters are going into
danger to quell a rebellion.

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:06.770
I can't stay in safety all by myself!

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.920
Rin Rin will take care of you both!

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:12.820
This honey water's perfect,
and my throat feels great!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:15.250
OK. It's about time.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.020
Let's do it.

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:17.000
Yeah.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:17.780
Kada-dono!

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:18.820
Right!

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:22.870
Sound! Lights!

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:24.710
Be healthy!

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:44.860
A single star, blooming in the night sky,

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:48.310
sends its feelings out to the milky way.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:55.820
A new story begins here. Dance
on this shining stage of dreams!

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:59.780
Everyone, listen to our song!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:02.560
Well?

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:03.720
Looking good.

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:05.310
No one's trying to stop us.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:11.310
These are all the kind who love the Chou Sisters' songs.
They're used to this kind of performance.

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:13.000
Nagi, Sawa, let's go!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:13.830
Sure.

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:14.830
You got it.

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:15.940
Be careful out there.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:16.720
Bye.

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:18.470
Ryuubi-dono...

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:22.590
Come on. Call me Onee-chan.

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:26.390
It's OK. No one who likes songs
could be a bad person.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.380
OK. See you!

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:34.090
Here you go!

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:36.030
We want you to support us with these!

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.660
We'll be singing in the open area,
in front of the stage.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:39.990
Get everyone together.

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:45.660
They're pretty cute!

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:46.460
Here!

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.180
Come support us with these!

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:49.610
She has nice boobs, too!

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:51.170
I'll do it! I'll do anything!

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:52.330
Really?

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:56.000
Then, will you hand these out to
the people at the open area?

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.630
There are still a bunch in the carriage.

00:10:57.910 --> 00:10:59.400
Yeah. Leave it to us!

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:00.590
Leave it to us!

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:04.080
I can't see!

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.560
Thanks, guys!

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:12.270
Hey, Chi-chan, it's noisy outside.

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.780
Did something happen?

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:17.480
Maybe the Yellow Turbans are practicing
their cheers or something.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.450
Nee-san, trouble!

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.940
What's wrong? You're pale.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:23.660
Are we under attack by the government?

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:25.620
Just come on!

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:29.790
What is that?

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:31.390
I don't know.

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:34.050
First thing I knew, they were
already this far in.

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:36.390
But this song is kind of nice.

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:38.260
How can you be so easygoing?

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:41.540
They're definitely planning something!

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:42.300
OK!

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:44.750
Let's get rid of them!

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:46.010
Change!

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:48.060
And dance!

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:52.640
Isn't the girl with glasses great?

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:54.480
I like Keifa-chan.

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:58.820
Wow, everyone likes the song
Sousou-sama wrote!

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:01.360
Your singing was great!

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:03.950
It sure was!

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:11.750
Everyone, get them out of here!

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.070
Everyone, quickly!

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:20.330
Yeah, dunno...

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:23.030
Please!

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:24.500
Let's all just get along!

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:25.590
Agreed!

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:29.060
Why? Why isn't the spell
working like always!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:33.150
OK. It's working like you
expected, old man.

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:34.410
I'm not old!

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:41.740
Chi-neesan, everyone's hearts must
have been captured by their songs!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.040
I see!

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:45.420
If the army attacks now...

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:47.270
Is that what they're after?

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:48.920
It's quite possible.

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:53.080
If the military came now, we'd
be captured right away, and...

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:57.060
What should we do!

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:59.040
It's simple!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:05.010
If their hearts have been stolen, we
just need to sing and retake them!

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:06.300
Chi-chan!

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:07.530
All right, then!

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:08.680
OK.

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:12.680
Awesome.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:15.420
Love is the strongest thing there is.

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:17.960
It makes the world go round.

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:20.520
I'm really, really serious.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.780
Now let's fight with love.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:28.450
I can't believe I get to see the
Chou Sisters sing up close!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.740
Sawa, don't get caught in it!

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:34.010
Let's sing right back at them!

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:35.120
Right!

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:38.160
We sent Ten'i out for reconnaissance
a while ago.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:39.910
She's not back yet?

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:42.540
No. Why don't you calm down a bit.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:44.520
It isn't like you.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:45.840
You're right.

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:48.160
It's starting to get cloudy.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:48.800
OK.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:51.760
Be safe, everyone...

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:59.930
If they're surrounded by tens of thousands
of Yellow Turbans, even Kan'u and her group...

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:02.070
Sister, the signal?

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:03.410
It hasn't come up.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.650
Nothing's happened.

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:08.610
If we have to attack, it'll
be a massive battle.

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.410
Everyone's enjoying themselves!

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.580
We might not have to fight!

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:21.610
No matter what kind of world awaits us,

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:24.210
I won't let go of your hand...

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:28.490
It's OK. Let's run toward tomorrow,

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:30.840
no matter the distance.

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:34.330
If you were to find the reason

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:37.920
for these tears,

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:40.020
then even the fact that we met...

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:42.780
Someday... Someday, I know,

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:45.360
our love will come true. It will come true!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.990
Someday... Someday, I know,

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:50.660
our love will come true. It will come true!

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:53.390
Someday... Someday, I know,

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:56.440
our love will come true. It will come true!

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:58.810
Great!

00:14:58.810 --> 00:14:59.780
Tenhou!

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:01.020
Chi-chan!

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:01.880
Ren-tan.

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:03.420
We're losing.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.340
All right. Then, I'll hit them
with my best shot!

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:14.760
Testing, testing!

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:17.130
No!

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:17.950
We're out of time!

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:18.680
What?

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.560
Do something, Choukun!

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.400
I don't know what to do!

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:26.280
I guess they ran out of magic.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:30.360
I don't know which mage they asked,
but it lasted quite a while.

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:35.870
But we have as much magic as we need, so
long as we have the <i>Crucial Keys</i>.

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:37.380
Now's our chance.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:43.000
Everyone, get them!

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:45.540
Get...

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:46.460
Them...

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.200
Is this it?

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:49.350
Rin Rin, let's go!

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:50.420
Got it!

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:51.850
Get...

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:52.890
Them...

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:53.780
No!

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:54.550
Withdraw!

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:56.060
Beat...

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:57.110
Them!

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:58.680
Ryuubi-han, hurry!

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:00.470
Kill...

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:01.720
Them!

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:11.260
Every night comes to an end.

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:14.450
That's what you taught me.

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:17.560
And now I know the meaning

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:20.500
of what you told me.

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:28.020
Comets falling in the winter sky,

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:34.340
believing in their future,
then falling and fading away.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:41.220
An eternal destiny speaks in our dreams,

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:48.250
if you believe in the feelings we share.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:55.820
You know, I wished upon the
stars we saw that day

00:16:55.820 --> 00:17:02.460
that we'd be together forever.

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:09.340
The map of the hope I'll take
with the hand you offered.

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:16.820
I believe now, even more, that
it will be ours someday.

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:13.470
It's useless!

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:14.820
Give it up already!

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:20.350
Leavings and partings...

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:22.580
Why?

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:25.810
Why is a song like that working?

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:35.650
I know. This song... A song everyone
can enjoy and become happy...

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:37.360
This song...

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:43.040
I'll blot it out with our song!

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:45.010
Let's stop.

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:50.360
Songs to control people... Or
to blot out other songs...

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:51.270
Songs like that...

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:52.870
What are you saying?

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:55.140
If we stop here, our dreams...

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:56.010
No.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:18:01.720
This isn't what we dreamed
of when we were kids...

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:04.890
...when we were kids...

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:08.700
Chi-chan!

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:09.360
Chi-neesan!

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:13.300
...and I know it will come true.

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:15.530
You're OK with it, right?

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:16.530
Yeah.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:17.560
Yeah.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.990
Everyone, listen to me!

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:29.150
As of today, the Yellow Turbans
are disbanding!

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:33.380
We're going back to being
normal performers!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:34.650
Sousou-sama!

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:35.800
Sousou-sama!

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:40.440
Sousou-sama, reporting in!

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:42.460
The Yellow Turbans have all surrendered!

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:46.230
The Three Chou Sisters have agreed to
hand over the <i>Crucial Keys</i>!

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:47.640
We did it!

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:48.730
Great!

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:54.610
That is indeed the <i>Crucial
Keys to the Way of Peace</i>.

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.240
Hang onto it tightly.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:01.530
I can see it!

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:06.330
My needle and body are one!
Body and soul, operating to the max!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:10.470
Be healthy!

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:11.750
Wait!

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:16.910
Isn't "Be healthy" a bit strange
to seal a book?

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:18.440
Come to think of it, you're right.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:21.800
You're...

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:23.380
Ukitsu.

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:26.170
I'm honored you remember.

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:32.770
But I'm disappointed. This was the perfect chance to gather
massive amounts of magic in the <i>Crucial Keys</i>.

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:35.290
Hey, wait!

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:37.270
Then, very well, everyone.

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:38.020
Hey...

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:40.510
May we meet again!

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:45.430
I'm sorry.

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:46.910
I let my guard down.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:51.790
At the very end we had the <i>Crucial
Keys</i> taken away by some guy...

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:54.880
Keifa, there's no sense in
blaming him further.

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:58.590
There's something else
we need to consider.

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:04.640
First, what we do with the Three Chou Sisters, and
then with those who joined the Yellow Turbans...

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:09.350
Even if they were being controlled by the <i>Crucial
Keys</i>, they did commit a crime.

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:12.060
I think they should be punished
to deter others.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:13.660
Wait!

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:17.160
They recognized what they were doing
was wrong and surrendered!

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:20.250
So please make their punishment
as light as possible!

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:22.130
I petition, also!

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:23.780
Um, Sousou-sama...

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.580
What's wrong, Kakuka?

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.330
Do you have some idea?

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:32.150
Yes. I believe we should place all the
Yellow Turbans under our command,

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:38.000
in the name of keeping
them from further evil.

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:43.120
In peacetime, we can use
them to work the fields,

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:47.930
and should another rebellion begin,
we can use them to quell it.

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:51.160
The Three Chou Sisters should
be made to visit and perform

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:53.790
for the armies stationed
around the country,

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:57.470
collecting donations for the poor,
in atonement for their actions.

00:20:57.470 --> 00:20:59.300
What do you think?

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:03.650
Punishing them strictly according to the law simply
increases the number of criminals in your lands.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:08.000
But this plan strengthens both
your army and your nation.

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:09.730
It's not bad.

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:13.020
I believe it may also improve your
reputation, Sousou-sama.

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:13.620
You're right.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:20.090
But it will take lots of training to turn
a bunch of groupies into real soldiers.

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:22.960
Sousou-sama, let me handle that.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:23.940
Please!

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:26.300
We'll help!

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:29.070
Very well.

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:31.270
I'll leave that to you.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:32.730
Right!

00:21:33.030 --> 00:21:34.610
But I'm surprised.

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:37.250
You're good for something
besides nosebleeds.

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:39.530
Actually...

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:43.650
You would be more suited as a
strategist than a bodyguard.

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:45.250
Then...

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:46.410
OK!

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:50.490
I'll go tell the Yellow Turbans!

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:54.940
She's gone.

00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:57.000
My, my... She's like a little kid.

00:21:57.400 --> 00:21:58.310
Kan'u,

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:01.630
you have bad taste in masters, as always.

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:04.250
That may be true.

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:10.390
But I think I have great taste
in sisters, little and big.

00:23:39.690 --> 00:23:43.060
We have to start all over again?

00:23:43.060 --> 00:23:44.940
Don't be so down.

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:48.220
As long as we three are
together, it'll be OK!

00:23:48.220 --> 00:23:51.580
Tenhou-neesan really is easygoing.

00:23:51.580 --> 00:23:53.810
Friendship is a beautiful thing!

00:23:56.440 --> 00:23:58.040
Who are you?

00:23:58.380 --> 00:24:01.550
At times, a mysterious, beautiful martial
artist who vanishes in the fog!

00:24:01.550 --> 00:24:04.620
At times, a wandering
bamboo shoot hunter.

00:24:04.620 --> 00:24:06.560
Yet her true identity is...

00:24:06.560 --> 00:24:09.000
A lone butterfly, descending from
heaven to a warring land,

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:10.050
the messenger of beauty and justice,

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:11.270
Butterfly Mask!

00:24:11.270 --> 00:24:14.680
I didn't really get a good opportunity
to do anything, but I'm here now!

00:24:17.730 --> 00:24:22.020
Here's a present from me to help
you with your new task!

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:23.060
Take it!

00:24:26.630 --> 00:24:30.870
If you wear this every day, from now on, and
perform as the Mysterious Masked Singers,

00:24:30.870 --> 00:24:32.610
you're sure to become popular!

00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:39.080
You'll be the talk of the town, full houses every
night, popular among young and old...

00:24:33.570 --> 00:24:35.220
Let's go to sleep.

00:24:35.220 --> 00:24:36.970
I'm tired.

00:24:36.970 --> 00:24:39.080
Let's keep it up tomorrow.

00:24:39.400 --> 00:24:41.980
Hey, let me fin-

00:24:49.310 --> 00:24:51.550
I do think they're cool masks, though...
